The '''Wand of Atonement''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Healing Wands|Healing Wand]] and [[Support items|Support Item]] unlocked at {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 7}}. It is an upgraded version of the {{Item|Wand of Restoration}} and the final upgrade in the [[Healing Wands|Healing Wand]] line.

